{"additional":"","additionalPlain":"","categories":{"commitment":"Independent Contractor - Project Based","department":"AI Trainers - Domain Experts","location":"United States","team":"Generalist","allLocations":["United States"]},"createdAt":1788466258925,"descriptionPlain":"Join the CrowdGen team as an Independent Contractor for Project Athabasca!\n \nWe are currently looking for thoughtful and introspective Independent Contractors to help evaluate whether AI systems truly understand people. In this role, contributors will review personalized questions and checklists about themselves and answer honestly based on their own experiences and preferences. Your responses will help improve AI-powered recommendation systems.\n \nRequirements:\n- Have a personal Instagram account\n- Be comfortable sharing your personal user history from Facebook and Instagram with our client\n- Have education or professional experience in fields such as counseling, psychology, or other fields where people are more likely to be introspective\n- Be comfortable reflecting on and providing honest responses about yourself\n- Have strong attention to detail and the ability to provide thoughtful, authentic responses\n \nData Privacy:\n- Contributors will be asked to share personal user history from Facebook and Instagram with our client for the purposes of this project. The data will remain confidential and will only be used to improve the recommendation system. It will not be used for any other purpose.\n \nCompensation:\n- The project rate is $18 per hour\n \nThis role is a project-based opportunity with CrowdGen, where you will join the CrowdGen Community as an Independent Contractor. If selected, you will receive an email from CrowdGen regarding the creation of an account using your application email address. You will need to log in to this account and reset the password, complete the setup requirements, and proceed with your application for this project-based role.\n \nIf you are interested in helping improve AI systems and are comfortable providing thoughtful, honest feedback about yourself, we’d love to have you on board. Apply today and become part of the CrowdGen Community for Project Athabasca!\n \n#crowdgen\n","description":"<div>Join the CrowdGen team as an Independent Contractor for <strong>Project Athabasca</strong>!</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>We are currently looking for thoughtful and introspective Independent Contractors to help evaluate whether AI systems truly understand people. In this role, contributors will review personalized questions and checklists about themselves and answer honestly based on their own experiences and preferences. Your responses will help improve AI-powered recommendation systems.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Requirements:</strong></div>\n<div>- Have a personal Instagram account</div>\n<div>- Be comfortable sharing your personal user history from Facebook and Instagram with our client</div>\n<div>- Have education or professional experience in fields such as counseling, psychology, or other fields where people are more likely to be introspective</div>\n<div>- Be comfortable reflecting on and providing honest responses about yourself</div>\n<div>- Have strong attention to detail and the ability to provide thoughtful, authentic responses</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Data Privacy:</strong></div>\n<div>- Contributors will be asked to share personal user history from Facebook and Instagram with our client for the purposes of this project. The data will remain confidential and will only be used to improve the recommendation system. It will not be used for any other purpose.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Compensation:</strong></div>\n<div>- The project rate is $18 per hour</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><em>This role is a project-based opportunity with CrowdGen, where you will join the CrowdGen Community as an Independent Contractor. If selected, you will receive an email from CrowdGen regarding the creation of an account using your application email address. You will need to log in to this account and reset the password, complete the setup requirements, and proceed with your application for this project-based role.</em></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>If you are interested in helping improve AI systems and are comfortable providing thoughtful, honest feedback about yourself, we’d love to have you on board. Apply today and become part of the CrowdGen Community for Project Athabasca!</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>#crowdgen</div>","id":"407f58a5-9991-408b-8d30-229f2917d6e7","lists":[],"salaryRange":{"min":18,"max":18,"currency":"USD","interval":"per-hour-wage"},"text":"AI Personalization Evaluation – English (United States); Project Athabasca","country":"US","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"","openingPlain":"","descriptionBody":"<div>Join the CrowdGen team as an Independent Contractor for <strong>Project Athabasca</strong>!</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>We are currently looking for thoughtful and introspective Independent Contractors to help evaluate whether AI systems truly understand people. In this role, contributors will review personalized questions and checklists about themselves and answer honestly based on their own experiences and preferences. Your responses will help improve AI-powered recommendation systems.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Requirements:</strong></div>\n<div>- Have a personal Instagram account</div>\n<div>- Be comfortable sharing your personal user history from Facebook and Instagram with our client</div>\n<div>- Have education or professional experience in fields such as counseling, psychology, or other fields where people are more likely to be introspective</div>\n<div>- Be comfortable reflecting on and providing honest responses about yourself</div>\n<div>- Have strong attention to detail and the ability to provide thoughtful, authentic responses</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Data Privacy:</strong></div>\n<div>- Contributors will be asked to share personal user history from Facebook and Instagram with our client for the purposes of this project. The data will remain confidential and will only be used to improve the recommendation system. It will not be used for any other purpose.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Compensation:</strong></div>\n<div>- The project rate is $18 per hour</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><em>This role is a project-based opportunity with CrowdGen, where you will join the CrowdGen Community as an Independent Contractor. If selected, you will receive an email from CrowdGen regarding the creation of an account using your application email address. You will need to log in to this account and reset the password, complete the setup requirements, and proceed with your application for this project-based role.</em></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>If you are interested in helping improve AI systems and are comfortable providing thoughtful, honest feedback about yourself, we&rsquo;d love to have you on board. Apply today and become part of the CrowdGen Community for Project Athabasca!</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>#crowdgen</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"Join the CrowdGen team as an Independent Contractor for Project Athabasca!\n \nWe are currently looking for thoughtful and introspective Independent Contractors to help evaluate whether AI systems truly understand people. In this role, contributors will review personalized questions and checklists about themselves and answer honestly based on their own experiences and preferences. Your responses will help improve AI-powered recommendation systems.\n \nRequirements:\n- Have a personal Instagram account\n- Be comfortable sharing your personal user history from Facebook and Instagram with our client\n- Have education or professional experience in fields such as counseling, psychology, or other fields where people are more likely to be introspective\n- Be comfortable reflecting on and providing honest responses about yourself\n- Have strong attention to detail and the ability to provide thoughtful, authentic responses\n \nData Privacy:\n- Contributors will be asked to share personal user history from Facebook and Instagram with our client for the purposes of this project. The data will remain confidential and will only be used to improve the recommendation system. It will not be used for any other purpose.\n \nCompensation:\n- The project rate is $18 per hour\n \nThis role is a project-based opportunity with CrowdGen, where you will join the CrowdGen Community as an Independent Contractor. If selected, you will receive an email from CrowdGen regarding the creation of an account using your application email address. You will need to log in to this account and reset the password, complete the setup requirements, and proceed with your application for this project-based role.\n \nIf you are interested in helping improve AI systems and are comfortable providing thoughtful, honest feedback about yourself, we’d love to have you on board. Apply today and become part of the CrowdGen Community for Project Athabasca!\n \n#crowdgen\n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/appen/407f58a5-9991-408b-8d30-229f2917d6e7","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/appen/407f58a5-9991-408b-8d30-229f2917d6e7/apply"}